# Changelog

All notable changes to this project are documented in this file. The format
follows Keep a Changelog.

## 0.2.0 - 2026-10-21

### Added
- Automatic switching: natural scrolling is turned off while a USB or Bluetooth
  mouse is connected, and the previous setting comes back when the last one
  goes away. Off by default.
- "Pointing devices" submenu listing what the app sees, with a checkbox to make
  it ignore a device. Rejected devices are greyed out with the reason.
- `ScrollCore` library with the device filter and the auto-switch policy, plus
  unit tests that run on macOS and Linux.
- `--devices` and `--backend` command line options.
- One-line installer (`install.sh`), Homebrew cask, GitHub Actions for CI and
  releases, Docker services for tests and lint, `Makefile`.

### Changed
- `./build.sh install` now does the local install into `/Applications`.
  `install.sh` downloads the latest release instead.

## 0.1.0 - 2026-10-21

### Added
- Menu bar app with a "Natural scrolling" checkbox. The change applies at once,
  without logging out.
- Launch at login.
- `--status`, `--toggle` and `--set on|off` command line options.
- `build.sh`, which builds the Swift package and packages an ad-hoc signed app
  bundle.
